  Slug: raised-by-belief
  DisplayName: Raised by Belief
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Whether in a monastery, a religious household, or just as part of
    your everyday life, your upbringing was steeped in the traditions of a particular
    deity. You might remain committed or you may have turned from your childhood
    creed, but your skills are still founded in your devotion. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to an attribute specified in your deity's Divine Attribute
    , and the other is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the deity's listed
    Divine Skill and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] feat
    with that skill. You gain a Lore skill related to your deity (Abadar Lore, for
    example).
